{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00655","headline":"郊庙歌辞 享太庙乐章 大明舞 · 张说","name":"郊庙歌辞 享太庙乐章 大明舞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"赤精乱德，四海困穷。\n黄旗举义，三灵会同。\n旱望春雨，云披大风。\n溥天来祭，高祖之功。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00655.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00655","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}